      "seed": 462533820,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 1506174468,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792160239319,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## Algorithm to Evaluate a Postfix Expression\n\n1. Start.\n2. Create an empty stack.\n3. Scan the postfix expression from left to right.\n4. If the scanned symbol is an **operand**, push it onto the\nstack.\n5. If the scanned symbol is an **operator**:\n   - Pop the top two operands from the stack.\n   - Apply the operator to them in the correct order:\n`secondOperand operator firstOperand`.\n   - Push the result onto the stack.\n6. Repeat until the entire expression is scanned.\n7. The final result is the top element of the stack.\n8. Stop.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## Algorithm to Evaluate a Postfix Expression\n\n1. Start.\n2. Create an empty stack.\n3. Scan the postfix expression from left to right.\n4. If the scanned symbol is an **operand**, push it onto the stack.\n5. If the scanned symbol is an **operator**:\n   - Pop the top two operands from the stack.\n   - Apply the operator to them in the correct order: `secondOperand operator firstOperand`.\n   - Push the result onto the stack.\n6. Repeat until the entire expression is scanned.\n7. The final result is the top element of the stack.\n8. Stop.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
